\b VideoEnhancer Installer and Third-Party Notice\b0\par
\par
VideoEnhancer is installed as a plugin for FFmpegFreeUI. Before selecting Install, open Options and choose the directory that contains the FFmpegFreeUI program.\par
\par
Application payload, configuration, models, caches, and update downloads stay under Plugin or Plugin\backslash videoenhancer. MSI records the selected location in HKLM\backslash Software\backslash VideoEnhancer. Uninstall removes that key and the uninstalling user's VideoEnhancer image shell menu.\par
\par
This package includes third-party components. Their notices and license texts are installed under Plugin\backslash videoenhancer. This notice does not grant a license for the VideoEnhancer project itself.\par
